.TH MOYU 1 "2026-10-23" "moyu 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
moyu \- terminal novel reader for TXT, EPUB, PDF and Markdown
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B moyu
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIFILE\fR]
.br
.B moyu web
[\fB\-\-port\fR \fIN\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-open\fR] [\fImoyu://...\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B moyu
is a local novel reader with a terminal interface and a local web reader.
It provides chapter navigation, full-text search, reading progress,
Kindle-style typography, paper themes, and a one-key disguise screen.
.PP
The web reader provides a cover bookshelf, typography controls, paged or
scrolling reading, and page-turn animations.
.PP
It reads TXT, EPUB, PDF, and Markdown files from local directories. PDF support requires
.B pdftotext
from the poppler-utils package.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B web
Start the local web reader and open it in the default browser.
.PP
The
.B moyu://shelf
and
.B moyu://read/\fIid\fR
URLs are handled by the desktop entry registered by this package.
.TP
.B \-\-port \fIN\fR
Port for the web reader (default: 8787).
.TP
.B \-\-no\-open
Start the web reader without opening a browser.
.TP
.B \-l, \-\-library
Open the bookshelf instead of a file.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-resume
Start reading from the beginning instead of the saved position.
.TP
.B \-\-debug
Print detailed error output to stderr.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help.
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
Show version.
.SH KEYS
.TP
.B Space, PageDown, f, Down
Next page.
.TP
.B b, PageUp, Up
Previous page.
.TP
.B j, k
Scroll down or up one line.
.TP
.B d, u
Scroll down or up half a page.
.TP
.B n, p
Next or previous chapter.
.TP
.B g
Table of contents.
.TP
.B /
Search the current book.
.TP
.B s
Bookshelf.
.TP
.B S, ,
Settings.
.TP
.B a
Toggle automatic page turning.
.TP
.B t
Toggle the header.
.TP
.B h
Toggle the key hint footer.
.TP
.B ~
Show the disguise screen.
.TP
.B ?
Help.
.TP
.B q
Quit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/moyu/config.json
User configuration.
.TP
.I ~/.config/moyu/progress.json
Reading progress.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR node (1),
.BR pdftotext (1)
